WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.914
In this video you will learn how to choose your
picture, change your name, set a new password,

00:00:06.034 --> 00:00:08.170
and sign out of OurWater.

00:00:08.983 --> 00:00:11.647
Your profile is one press away.

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:15.055
The round picture at the bottom of the menu is
you.

00:00:15.883 --> 00:00:21.259
Press it, and a small menu opens with Profile,
Settings and Sign out.

00:00:21.379 --> 00:00:23.275
Now press Profile.

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:26.315
This is your profile page.

00:00:26.435 --> 00:00:32.267
It holds your picture, name, language and
password, and the button to sign out.

00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:35.747
The big round picture is your avatar.

00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:38.795
It also shows at the bottom of your menu.

00:00:39.617 --> 00:00:44.489
Beside it are your name, the kind of account
you have, and your ID number.

00:00:45.317 --> 00:00:47.957
Under it is a row of small pictures.

00:00:48.077 --> 00:00:50.213
Choose one to stand for you.

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:54.425
You cannot upload your own photo, on purpose.

00:00:54.545 --> 00:00:59.129
With no real faces, nobody can copy or misuse
your picture.

00:00:59.249 --> 00:01:02.321
These pictures also work with no internet.

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:05.022
Press the water drop.

00:01:05.142 --> 00:01:07.542
Your picture changes at once.

00:01:07.662 --> 00:01:09.750
There is nothing to save.

00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:18.407
Press the dashed button to see every picture, in
groups: water, animals, plants, and sky and land.

00:01:19.217 --> 00:01:21.089
Choose any you like.

00:01:21.209 --> 00:01:24.593
We press the lion, and a ring shows your
choice.

00:01:25.417 --> 00:01:27.913
Press Show less to fold the list.

00:01:28.033 --> 00:01:30.385
Your choice moves to the front.

00:01:31.217 --> 00:01:33.089
Changed your mind?

00:01:33.209 --> 00:01:36.185
Press the letter to go back to the plain
picture.

00:01:37.017 --> 00:01:39.705
To change your name, press Edit.

00:01:39.825 --> 00:01:43.857
Two boxes open: your full name, and your
username.

00:01:44.683 --> 00:01:47.635
Type your full name the way you want it shown.

00:01:47.755 --> 00:01:50.371
You can change it again any time.

00:01:51.183 --> 00:01:54.351
Your username is the short name you sign in
with.

00:01:54.471 --> 00:02:00.399
Use three to thirty small letters, numbers,
dots, dashes or underscores.

00:02:00.519 --> 00:02:03.999
Two people in one country cannot share a
username.

00:02:04.817 --> 00:02:10.337
If a username is not allowed, a red message
tells you why, and nothing is saved.

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:14.630
Type an allowed username and press Save
changes.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:18.134
The boxes close, and your new name shows.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:25.022
Below are your email, with a green tick when it has
been checked, then your country and your status.

00:02:25.142 --> 00:02:28.334
You can read them here, but not change them.

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:32.510
Under App preferences, choose your language.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.646
The whole app changes to it.

00:02:34.766 --> 00:02:38.390
The full list of more than sixty languages is
in Settings.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:40.718
We will leave it as it is.

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:44.934
To get a new password, press Change password.

00:02:45.054 --> 00:02:47.886
OurWater does not ask for the old one.

00:02:48.006 --> 00:02:50.406
It sends a code to your email.

00:02:51.217 --> 00:02:53.881
A new page asks for your email.

00:02:54.001 --> 00:02:56.689
Type the email your account uses.

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.425
You stay signed in while you do this.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:02.386
Press Send reset code.

00:03:02.506 --> 00:03:06.394
A code is sent to your email, and this box
waits for it.

00:03:06.514 --> 00:03:09.418
If it is late, look in your junk folder.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.578
Then choose your new password.

00:03:12.698 --> 00:03:18.986
It needs at least eight characters, with a capital
letter, a small letter, a number and a symbol.

00:03:19.106 --> 00:03:20.978
We stop here.

00:03:21.783 --> 00:03:25.311
The profile page does not show the Terms you
agreed to.

00:03:25.431 --> 00:03:30.231
To read them again, open Settings, and look
under Privacy and data.

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:34.746
Terms and Conditions are the rules for using
OurWater.

00:03:34.866 --> 00:03:37.722
You agreed to them when you first signed in.

00:03:37.842 --> 00:03:41.226
The Privacy Policy says what information we
keep.

00:03:41.346 --> 00:03:43.578
Each opens in a new tab.

00:03:44.383 --> 00:03:46.687
At the bottom is Delete account.

00:03:46.807 --> 00:03:49.927
It removes your profile and sign-in for good.

00:03:50.047 --> 00:03:54.895
The stations and measurements you added stay
for everyone, without your name.

00:03:55.717 --> 00:03:58.789
Pressing it asks for your password first.

00:03:58.909 --> 00:04:02.653
Nothing is deleted until you type it and press
the red button.

00:04:03.483 --> 00:04:07.179
We press Cancel instead, and nothing changes.

00:04:07.983 --> 00:04:10.143
Last, Sign out.

00:04:10.263 --> 00:04:13.095
Use it on a shared phone or computer.

00:04:13.215 --> 00:04:15.495
Your measurements stay saved.

00:04:16.317 --> 00:04:19.917
Press Sign out, and you are back at the
sign-in page.

00:04:20.717 --> 00:04:22.613
That is your profile.

00:04:22.733 --> 00:04:25.397
Thanks for helping look after our water.
